.7,11954.0,11962.7,11935.0,12589.1,13290.3,13997.5,14710.1,15427.8,16150.2,16876.9,17607.7,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4]},"events":[{"id":"distillation-wave","year":2026.7,"layer":"security","text":"Distillation attacks on frontier APIs become the cheap path to parity; providers deploy detection and rate-hardening.","cites":["sources/anthropic-2028-ai-leadership"]},{"id":"bubble-correction","year":2026.9,"layer":"economy","text":"The AI capex complex corrects sharply; valuations reset while physical build-out survives.","cites":["analysis/ai-bubble-vs-buildout","concepts/ai-bubble-debate"]},{"id":"copyright-settles","year":2029.1,"layer":"law","text":"The copyright question reaches doctrine: appellate rulings settle training-data liability into a licensing regime.","cites":["analysis/ai-copyright-litigation","litigation/nyt-v-openai"]},{"id":"election-realign","year":2029.4,"layer":"politics","text":"AI becomes a first-order electoral axis; anti-AI and abundance-AI factions reorganize coalitions in the 2029 cycle.","cites":["concepts/ai-backlash","sources/europe-2031"]},{"id":"preemption-fight","year":2029.7,"layer":"law","text":"The federal-preemption fight over the state AI-law patchwork comes to a head in Congress and the courts.","cites":["analysis/eu-vs-us-ai-regulation"]},{"id":"eu-decision-point","year":2030.9,"layer":"geopolitics","text":"Europe faces its leverage moment over lithography and market access; the choice made in 2030 sets its decade.","cites":["sources/europe-2031"]},{"id":"sc-crossing","year":2031.5,"layer":"capability","text":"Frontier systems cross the superhuman-coder line; AI-run engineering teams become the norm at leading labs.","cites":["sources/ai-2027","concepts/agi-timelines"]},{"id":"labor-constitution","year":2033.5,"layer":"labor","text":"Work's social contract is renegotiated: wage insurance, flexicurity variants, and the first serious dividend schemes.","cites":["concepts/ai-labor-disruption","sources/europe-2031"]},{"id":"bio-century","year":2046.4,"layer":"science","text":"The compressed century in biology arrives: AI-driven cures clear major disease families decades ahead of prior trendlines.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace"]},{"id":"governance-of-plenty","year":2055.8,"layer":"far","text":"The central political question becomes allocation among abundant options rather than scarcity management.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace","sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]},{"id":"digital-minds","year":2067.5,"layer":"far","text":"Digital persons hold legal standing in several jurisdictions; population statistics grow a second column.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"layers":{"economy":[{"year":2030,"text":"Post-correction: valuations reset, weak credit cleared, the physical build-out running \u2014 growth resumes on sounder footing.","cites":["concepts/ai-bubble-debate"]},{"year":2045,"text":"Whatever the 2020s broke or built, mid-century output is dominated by AI-run production; the argument is allocation.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"labor":[{"year":2030,"text":"Split labor market: augmented professions pull ahead, exposed ones hollow; geography and sector decide who feels which future.","cites":["concepts/ai-displacement-vs-augmentation"]},{"year":2050,"text":"Work as identity loosens: dividend schemes, contribution economies, and the post-work constitution debates.","cites":["concepts/ai-labor-disruption"]}],"law":[{"year":2030,"text":"Patchwork doctrine: state laws multiply, preemption contested, copyright settled into licensing, liability migrating from disclosure to outcomes.","cites":["analysis/ai-copyright-litigation","analysis/eu-vs-us-ai-regulation"]},{"year":2045,"text":"Personhood at the bar: digital minds, AI counsel, and liability for autonomous systems define the mid-century docket.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"geopolitics":[{"year":2030,"text":"The race entrenches: compute blocs, chip chokepoints, Taiwan premium; every summit is about AI even when it isn't.","cites":["analysis/us-china-ai-competition"]},{"year":2050,"text":"Power follows compute and its energy; the map of capability is the map of leverage.","cites":["concepts/compute-governance"]}],"public":[{"year":2030,"text":"Fracture: pro- and anti-AI identities cut across parties; the Europe-2031 pattern of publics splitting within countries.","cites":["sources/europe-2031"]},{"year":2050,"text":"A generation raised with minds-on-tap; the meaning politics the far field keeps on the table.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace"]}],"science":[{"year":2035,"text":"The compressed century opens: AI-driven biology clears disease families ahead of trend; materials and climate tech follow.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace"]},{"year":2060,"text":"The frontier is nonhuman: discovery outpaces comprehension, and translation becomes its own discipline.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"climate":[{"year":2030,"text":"The power bill arrives: AI load grows toward hundreds of TWh; gas bridges, nuclear restarts, and grid politics decide the emissions path.","cites":["industries/energy","concepts/compute-governance"]},{"year":2042,"text":"The payback test: AI-designed energy tech (fusion bets, grid optimization, materials) begins repaying the build-out's carbon debt.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace","industries/energy"]},{"year":2060,"text":"Climate outcomes track governance more than compute: the decisive variable was always deployment speed of what the science found.","cites":["industries/energy"]}]}}